+## Access
+
+- API keys are `apiKeys: [{ key, name, role }]` with role `viewer`, `cook`
+  or `manager`. Keys are unique and not empty.
+- Audit entries (`audit: [{ at, keyName, method, path, status }]`) are only
+  appended, never edited or deleted, in the order the requests were made.
